Id: ngx010i
Severity: INFO
Category: services
Check: check_nginx
Fix: Send Strict-Transport-Security (add_header, with max-age).
References: ngx_http_headers_module; RFC 6797

A server does HTTPS without Strict-Transport-Security: first visits
can be silently downgraded to HTTP. The header is one line, and
belongs on every HTTPS server.
